{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1346,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daa2a501019d1bbaa91a1a7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点开始吧。\r\n热身早就完成了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86833efdde533e1e8b40d08399d29ba6a1f6974c851442a2e2b626cd45e6497c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b4fb51aad7b7e49b826cca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "TRIAL&ERROR什么的……\r\n现在可不是说这种话的时候。\r\n我可是打从一开始就准备全力以赴的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33b12657e7fc4c41e2d02a0474f86004690726121e875b901e087b64474186f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa0a13913ee4ad81df71ff6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要和我一起训练的话我倒没什么意见，\r\n但要拖了我的后腿的话我可不干啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62759ae1299490685c259b571af152e3d3d951610c457f099dc77b91729dc6e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:131cb30e6bba1bb4b09db46c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可别太出风头了啊。\r\n……你得搞清楚自己的定位啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c8abb5a041306eb061b21264ca53d81b0c239a222d482b3e4f5e7363df119b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f55255ddc6dc6d5b07dc5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "归根结底，你就是所谓强化役【Buffer】吧。\r\n……后援可要好好加油跟上哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6709e93585c66b90bd06f47eba2286c30288e5478d034e4210f7496c73544313",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64d6eff8d504c16468495633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "他人のくだらない評価なんて\r\n全部覆してやる…。\r\nとっととトレーニングするよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09f5d6d27d3a0f3c776b47b2502f649ecbc54924947c0e5c4a3ea27f9615a48d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2cfba440bcaef3f472a90e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝つか負けるかゼロかイチか。\r\n勝負って結構デジタルじゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ce6ce5f047f94992dd7cd47c8e50deeaba4fbb9eb1a5c91cd89b961af1e1487",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e82cbe24615bcc57e143dee9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パッと見、加速装置とかついてても\r\nおかしくないよね、このシューズ。\r\nまあ、そんなもの必要ないけど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7ebff16b504d5a0b4a07e358b45cac683023a278fdcdceb5895099175a394f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb07d6209dd20bb1465d3248",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "準備なんてとっくにできてる。\r\nあとはやるだけ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dfd762bc7dc5d9c569e238fb982414eecfb530bda31ff6d72d12826e97a8eee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d8e25494f2051b006c7c3e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目立つ格好してレース出れば\r\nバカなヤツらもわかるでしょ？\r\n誰が1番速いかって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e483a88a8bc964a5e20ad8c996d88a92a87f6522e4911efb7d867c338fccb2d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f6a750023b1a34581a5a00a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ナメられたら終わりだから、立ち\r\n止まったりしない。ダイナモだって\r\n動いてれば光は消えないでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "780523da965c8bfdcdd283e6313a602420ac17b243370d780ecbe47e543b58e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af7ebc5857ac34145619ff92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゲームのレベリングも\r\nトレーニングも同じ。結局最後に\r\n大事になるのは積み重ねた量だから",
      "source_fingerprint": "a596790740f8a6c460ea147bf3e28c06535104e33267c149b3d4de4c53031e97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12011ade57f190db89bca1ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你组成一队……嘛，也算不错吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c864260a744b9782264aad18be990351bbc8b789d6ecd960ca6f2f0d01688a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89d5468d8c71147b250f7f1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。这不也留下了不错的成果嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fbd49c6266894844b901365d6b76fb8f65b87c2891e9d0bcac34147bc2b2081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d2f8f73404580ad433ecf62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多谢你的支持啦……还不赖吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e05d9348ba8df24b3808d701e9952344944c8d36d4975440f0c74d8b597c6f61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f1767f4d02c9b5aa75c6cb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不够。下次朝着更高的目标努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9632aa19b8e758e29b8fe7724a4ea8c08657fe73dc152baa7102edc2b01e397c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8875245912783baf7ab7d03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アンタのセットアップ、\r\nまあまあ…よかったよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb655a9adeb305b64d7158771a5b67d64fa2ca6e9880d7498bc83d84260f098b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f0c00938802cff94aef25f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ナイスバックアップ…少しはやるじゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21da1e21ed2b70d1fee19001e7d0f08fecaa312c9e94045358721ebb23e30683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d11fbbcb5544266d1b12f226",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不够……还需要再继续磨练……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "200a094c754aeee2450f7256185a84da830dfae09a3f26ab889bc4d88daab4e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:458db0234453e3fa02e84f66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高墙……看我把它们全部破坏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeeede8ba700ba2e77b8a7b28dc4499a45d68334f315cc287c10ab4dba199083",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53588cf80d5c9f781f4da462",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成田大进。\n小瞧我的话就踹飞你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "786b960eb436b08756e5f131a8d6c5e64b0dcea1681cd5dc87b82f260b291de9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21d6cdcc6bb7a921cdc1e6af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这家伙也是、那家伙也是！\n全都看不起我！\n那我就要赢给他们看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0eab0477a18915f7404396ed321dcc1e8f63f3549b3c364c7c010f22bd9e5e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499d5139d06dea8660c22f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "背负这么多期待，反而有些困扰了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a75796621540268ecbbd217ee79310d0a207efac78a888b5715a4d3049c6657",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c2c8103ff65eff181cbb2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我尽力而为吧……尽力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "162e4cbd8960267d479cf42b8639a3c2efae33c62e873a65cb4fada4616f6180",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c7d1906455067ac95d03e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等级提升……也就这种感觉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e84c0b45eea25c170b90e8b266f860863def8f90cc9dc71a2a1133b7b9ae1a7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab051a943cd313b8ff75ff26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出力提升……能行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a34e104d2d90f9d240047f54ffe48aef8493531f26ca97fc115dc460b88bb0be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed13908d69c6c69aa47c6fee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是坏到四分五裂……\r\n我也会无数次地将它修好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f1cc3a0a21a1adf16238fe0df22a0e369c107b71d26e7f1d44293aeec3f569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f93ad5d89f1a7b6e567ac3f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成田大进。\r\n你就是助手？……这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e869883f1f440eae395d968f1349df6a70d56edfd0b3ad7a0b79cc283dc9452",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5b22b4178c56e0a089be259",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アップデートはしていかないとね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "309bcfb3f99fa7d6e8098773c95772fd70c8132043b49c7d6b5219dc8dcb974f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ee726fe3fa56f0fedbb441",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界って、突破するもんでしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e75052e136fbe49a48b045874b8e41ff53725f89754b5018893d8e2f735fbcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404e82c81ab10905d74b9c9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有象無象のノイズなんて、\r\nフルブーストでかき消してやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69354f682c5094efdd203cb1229364a1f84f099078e1734850cfb1379651b3ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:589c13d3e723ec504606c604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ナリタタイシン。\r\nアタシのターン、始めるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fd7d852e870689b6222f418ef9cf50d2ee1fb5e32946d98f716b13ef3715737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10aba1ceb24562ec25fa0010",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b58d964d17854a803d16140a894079104ae8c9281e306d5f49a7ec42fc0837d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa3610fa83940023de85712",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用我的表现替大家带来勇气……\r\n我要和训练员一起努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "426654848b8baab340ae61ea5c1052357394b7af6978ed8cc284f423be757cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601a8bbc5ce39b181ed8345b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2746adcd39fdf414dbc71ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りましたっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16bf5f790acc52a1ff5f3ff54960e35e09cd3f2ce1d51f4b726df01647b94044",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fefc223d14d065dbbafb509d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然现在还很小，\r\n但将来一定能成为漂亮的花朵……\r\n我现在已经能够相信自己了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94fae4cf458619a8622e7d47a5844866ce9cbc080a8de3b567b21c530cb6decf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf7d77d06adfe295820ab0c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要一起去野餐？\r\n顺便一起做便当……然后，\r\n我想和你在花田尽情聊天♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb57eed94523506c9aa0b28d13cdcebee671eab2f1d01f87aae2e0a39b40640a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:458352deac560792fd30c043",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃了自己做的年菜后，\r\n就会觉得新的一年真的到了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee7fdf141268747d89ef198f1654d5bbdf7dacf5e1ab60745afc7e825e6f107",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:141a78998b01ac6519409479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明是情人节，\r\n大家却都拜托我做萩饼。\r\n是因为喜欢我做的萩饼吗……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a09b881a0fa7c4f17fac2b875804d0f92e373668915b55c08e986906e7e8c678",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61c0c9e898db2881319e4c94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我用各种口味的巧克力，\r\n做成花坛的样子！就当作是感谢\r\n你平时的照顾……请收下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f84f4af66736c106b24a684c4dea9ed2076c240372edf578c9bf68f8711181f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f70fcfac47a5ae6c540a43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在短签上写好愿望了吗？\r\n我想再长大一点……\r\n啊，不对，这是秘密！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bfbfa26f28c9bcf71e3cc12ffea6e014197a682527d95869c6939d68a13be76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06517b0368e448894bba968a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "色拉、炖菜和甘露煮……\r\n再搭配灯笼，\r\n做道南瓜料理怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28f32b22a8f7df6682e0e768d4b65ed70cc8b2af6fce69302def8a3897c5857e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c93e0c73ec316956f069c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和进王一起做蛋糕真的很开心，\r\n一回想起来就会不自觉露出笑容♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae40673c8fc1b0a4195b0f38404b8d95558cd136151edc7898e9088f2a0248e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f61abddcb026e73a404e701",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我试着做了圣诞花圈。\r\n希望能装饰在训练员室，\r\n跟你一起享受圣诞节的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61dff3e59313663c3351971b598691cd889a523354160b333c6d7e144c6054a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89149c8db55387318093bf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cc41bc55c0b9a9f9ae1ee2c5d386dedd6f683f15bf1552dcb0f027ff3a02fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51e856cfd1ec3d077728e1a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果大扫除时人手不够，\r\n随时都可以找我喔。\r\n不介意的话，就让我帮忙吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "485bbc63a80089c219f0725e6f69ff229b24bfb93303bcc92a3db6641d661677",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f989fa5ab42e05ff60786b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐♪\r\n我烤了很多蛋糕，\r\n晚点一起庆祝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c2d3867a7b7c0cd5f20bdfe9ae8a714c0b640d27cce87db22f1477b105e90f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b152b20229768ebbbed361c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我会用心唱的……！\r\n祝你生～日～快～乐♪\r\n祝你生～日～快～乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92b74252c3c2e27279c55062a4b9bd835bc2deff50911fa71610deb6b1f42e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66b322d1cb8fd8203cb7e723",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊……！\r\n你记得我的生日啊。\r\n我真的好开心喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f70c135c4e1f387f4a2a78f256d7cf0cc8002d79b6e9ce546e39cb8b9bd98c39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca46e88533dfcf741ce4c43e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "庆祝生日吗？\r\n那我想和你一起去植物园……！\r\n现在是天竺葵开花的时期♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "563475fc417c0cb0ea68db8626dd52e793dfd1ae7f146be24dc344a95ae45a7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:220628aa50ce338a15d6be7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员、训练员。\r\n收到新公告啰♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "be1f9866bf25f47a95b07b1dde4572e8220713e4646fc9085304d516ccbaf5f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bab29bf9b6a782f20b1873ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊～收到礼物了！\r\n那个，要我去帮你拿吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4531aceddeb0110b554dad642678ba55676987b8de91c779eb01444bf934df31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5842cfc1b1c5b52b4e06f6fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成，\r\n画一朵小花送你！\r\n……嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9fd0f8efb7abc3bbccc89be1064487960a3cc36f5f8a5bade00744478364da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:490a659a4519c20c3372f594",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就快要举办活动了♪\r\n不晓得到时候要做什么？\r\n我有点在意……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f25dc70749cf6628891307a316c894014fddf665c4a6745da503f880567b98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c093865b2b7e4d2e6fa5ee71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊，这次的活动感觉很有趣♪\r\n那个……我可以跟你一起去看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81e0919bc8cfd861ada278ffe8db8e53b07f98ec46a32a93ebcc29afc2c14897",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52caea19c0190413a32e8d1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是再努力一点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6acdabe3b34983cade9c5db2321cf29da17046388f300dd69b1e41314def56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:525e63d30ffd4fd31e053a01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n似乎提升了！\r\n要去看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "654fe5c69daa6126d8a5d818025157b557b1da39cb22a75f4fa62b933f543d1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8e4ab426d6d1032b83e6d89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カーディガンの裾がなみなみで、\r\nカーネーションみたいだなぁって…\r\nえっと、ひとめぼれ、でした…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53d60ee5374f028b3d72c8a21095e07491fc7d3ef6df22fe32d9d8904d61d9ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bede2643f2b60a223d7cce3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつもお洋服は、お母さんと\r\n一緒に選ぶんですけど…私より\r\nいっぱい、悩んでくれるんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a4c7c6f32752919a04e875a622c775dc75de9e51d7a406812f62d026682f753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ef95fc50313f4c2ecf8242a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園のお姉さんたちのお洋服、\r\nとっても自由ですよね。…私も、\r\nたくさん挑戦してみたい…ですっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32070061c56b5e8f192b4c483d67ab739d7cf221648bb4bf057628954e37472d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e4b048198281559a549431d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就差一步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "573e02ec0d24fbdb60925613e6034141e68c3b7b1a01929b853c73f80b29aa64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c19d56332bd899e23b008781",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，赢了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f283a428beaf7b5346d878894a1da3d4336debc8a960607ec8e649b4493fc343",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
